    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "uVvko",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 22000,
      "name": "V2 / 校园 / 评审记录",
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$campus-surface",
      "cornerRadius": 24,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "glec0",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "content": "校园页 · 为什么这样排",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TVzoC",
          "name": "学生打开「校园」的真",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "学生打开「校园」的真实问题：我回家/去坑口那班车几点？有没有更快的？其次才是：东西在哪、事情怎么办。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "N4mMBx",
          "name": "旧版（12 / Ca",
          "fill": "$campus-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "旧版（12 / Campus）的问题",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RJpWY",
          "name": "· 首屏 1/3 是",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 首屏 1/3 是风景照，3 秒内看不出能做什么\n· 交通出现 3 次：校巴卡、校巴时刻表、九巴与小巴，却写死「北闸出发」\n· 校巴、九巴、图书馆、学生服务混在一个「出行与服务」列表\n· 麦克风、地图按钮没有真实功能\n· 收藏、重要事务在原生里有，在这页没有",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "r5FPNJ",
          "name": "这版的决定",
          "fill": "$campus-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "这版的决定",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "E9bOq",
          "name": "1 我的下一班：只显",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1 我的下一班：只显示你选的路线 + 闸口的实时小巴/巴士。校巴标「时刻表」，实时预测带绿点，两种可信度一眼分开（参考 Transit：打开即看到附近线路倒数）\n2 办事进度：只放进行中的事务，指南放进「全部指南」，不再重复\n3 我的常用用列表，和下方分类方格区分开，避免看起来是同一种东西\n4 校园生活四格：学习空间 / 吃喝购物 / 学生服务 / 找课室（房间号交给 Path Advisor，不假装有室内导航）\n5 去掉风景大图、麦克风和假地图",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n5Qqi",
          "name": "还需要补的状态画板：",
          "fill": "$ios-orange",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "还需要补的状态画板：第一次使用未选路线 · 今晚已无班次（显示明早首班）· 没有收藏 · 实时预测失败只剩时刻表",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Lvu6I",
          "name": "数据依据：/tran",
          "fill": "$campus-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "数据依据：/transport/routes（23 条校巴，计划班次）、/transport/public（KMB/GMB 实时 ETA）、/campus/places（9 个已核验地点，分 study/shop/service）、/me/campus/bookmarks、affairs。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
